  "general_F_support_proof": "At pooled Newton order n=j+q-overlap, each of the j+q nilpotent page steps has beta degree at least 2. Hence d>=2(j+q)=2(n+overlap)>=2n. For B_k this gives d>=2k, and after the universal beta^4 factor, F_k starts no earlier than beta^(2(k-2)). Fresh-label minimal-mask objects make the first coefficient monic of s-degree 2(k-2), so it is not the zero polynomial.",
